  "prompt": "<|begin_of_text|><|start|>system<|message|>You write CadQuery Python code. Units are millimetres. Assign the final solid to a variable named result. Reply with exactly one Python code block and nothing else.\n\nReasoning strength: high.\n\n# Valid recipients: \"self\", \"user\".<|eot|><|start|>user<|message|>Units: millimetres. Z is up. A spool (bobbin) on the Z axis, centred at X = 0, Y = 0. Bottom flange: diameter 42.4, Z from 0 to 3.5. Core: diameter 21.8, Z from 3.5 to 23.2. Top flange: diameter 42.4, Z from 23.2 to 26.7. A centre bore of diameter 6.8 goes through everything along the Z axis. A wire slot 4.4 wide cuts through the bottom flange along X: X from -22.2 to 22.2, Y from -2.2 to 2.2, Z from 0 to 3.5.<|eot|><|start|>assistant",
  "full": "<|begin_of_text|><|start|>system<|message|>You write CadQuery Python code. Units are millimetres. Assign the final solid to a variable named result. Reply with exactly one Python code block and nothing else.\n\nReasoning strength: high.\n\n# Valid recipients: \"self\", \"user\".<|eot|><|start|>user<|message|>Units: millimetres. Z is up. A spool (bobbin) on the Z axis, centred at X = 0, Y = 0. Bottom flange: diameter 42.4, Z from 0 to 3.5. Core: diameter 21.8, Z from 3.5 to 23.2. Top flange: diameter 42.4, Z from 23.2 to 26.7. A centre bore of diameter 6.8 goes through everything along the Z axis. A wire slot 4.4 wide cuts through the bottom flange along X: X from -22.2 to 22.2, Y from -2.2 to 2.2, Z from 0 to 3.5.<|eot|><|start|>assistant to=user<|message|>```python\nimport cadquery as cq\n\n# Bottom flange: diameter 42.4, Z 0 to 3.5\nbottom_flange = cq.Workplane(\"XY\").circle(42.4 / 2).extrude(3.5)\n\n# Core: diameter 21.8, Z 3.5 to 23.2 (height 19.7)\ncore = cq.Workplane(\"XY\", origin=(0, 0, 3.5)).circle(21.8 / 2).extrude(23.2 - 3.5)\n\n# Top flange: diameter 42.4, Z 23.2 to 26.7 (height 3.5)\ntop_flange = cq.Workplane(\"XY\", origin=(0, 0, 23.2)).circle(42.4 / 2).extrude(26.7 - 23.2)\n\n# Union all three parts of the spool\nresult = bottom_flange.union(core).union(top_flange)\n\n# Centre bore: diameter 6.8 through entire height 26.7 along Z axis\nbore_cutter = cq.Workplane(\"XY\").circle(6.8 / 2).extrude(26.7)\nresult = result.cut(bore_cutter)\n\n# Wire slot in bottom flange: X -22.2 to 22.2 (44.4), Y -2.2 to 2.2 (4.4), Z 0 to 3.5\nslot_cutter = cq.Workplane(\"XY\").box(44.4, 4.4, 3.5, centered=(True, True, False))\nresult = result.cut(slot_cutter)\n```<|eot|>"
